  unitName: Fast Princess Lucana
  unitId: 40293
  unitNumber: 649
  description: A Summoner who led many civilians to El Gaia during the last stages
    of the war with the gods. By the time the invasion of the gods had commenced,
    her name and abilities as a Summoner were already well known, and she received
    invitations from all countries asking her to join their armies. However, it is
    said that she turned down all of the invitations in order to protect the hometown
    where she was born. Shortly, she began to hear the voices of the gods in her
    dreams, which revealed to her a way to help the humans escape from the invasion.
    The next day she immediately decided to contact her childhood friend fighting
    far away.
  summonDesc: I fight to rid people of their grief!<br>You'll help me too,<br>won't
    you?
  fusionDesc: What is this power?<br>I can feel someone's will...<br>But it's not
    that weird, for some reason.
